Hatch is currently seeking a **Service Desk Technician** based in our **Mississauga** office, reporting to IT Service Desk Technician you will support offices globally. **Please note this is a 12\-month contract position.**

 **As the successful candidate, you will:**



* Assist in providing desktop services to end\-users in local offices and to remote offices daily, including PCs, telephones, mobile phones, network equipment and other IT services;
